OL,3,GNEWSATT sidecar racing 'fighting for
OL,4,Aits future'
OL,5,
OL,6,FRiders taking part in the Classic
OL,7,FSidecar Parade at the Classic TT have
OL,8,Fspoken about what a future without
OL,9,Fsidecars at the TT would mean.
OL,11,FA 'sustainability review' is underway
OL,12,Fafter sidecar racing was suspended
OL,13,Fduring the Isle of Man TT in June
OL,14,Fbecause of safety concerns.
OL,16,FThe review into the suspended class is
OL,17,Fstill ongoing, with early findings in
OL,18,FJuly suggesting sidecars could return
OL,19,Fin 2027 after major reform.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB IOM NewsC Reg TVF Clean Feed
FL,451,445,260,140,0,100
